{
  "bridge_text": "With the center of that old oak carved out by time, the empty space inside held secrets the village had long forgotten. Lina stood before the dark opening, her red coat glowing against the frost.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "The humming grew louder as she stepped closer to the bark. Though the grown-ups stayed away, Lina reached out a mittened hand, ready to discover what lived inside the heart of the great, empty tree."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Inside the hollow space, she found a curl of stairs winding down into the earth. At the very top step sat an old grey fox in a patched green vest named Mosk. He told her, in a voice like dry leaves, that she should go home and forget the humming, but Lina refused to leave a story half-heard."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}
